                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Massive amount of RNG reliance, I've reached the point where I want to keep playing as I like the graphics, concept and feel of the game, but there's sometimes no way of winning if the wrong baddies turn up on a dungeon when you're 80% through a level. What was fun for a bit becomes frustrating and you don't get enough food to grind through.\r\n\r\nSo this positive comes with a big caveat - you must like grinding, and appreciate when a game just doesn't want you to win. \r\n\r\nCan I not review as 'OK, if you like that sort of thing'?",
